  "_about": "Athletic commission result records captured for the TUF archive. Facts only: the commission's own documents are not redistributed. A document is authoritative for a bout ONLY through an explicit record here, tied to that bout by its corners, date and result, and cited from the bout's result_sources by document_id and record_id. A URL on a government domain is never authoritative by itself.",
  "_policy": {
    "authority": "A commission result record is a primary source for the house result it records (winner, method, round, time, cards, officials) and for the classification language the document prints.",
    "normalization": "method is the commission wording normalized to the archive's form; result_text keeps the printed sentence. Decision rounds are the scheduled rounds printed in the Rds column. Times are the commission's; a decision carries no time because none is printed.",
    "names": "corners keep the commission's printed names (including its misspellings); `bout` maps the record to the bracket bout by the archive's names.",
    "scorecards": "as printed: `order` names the corner each card lists first."
  },
